      "statement": "Traefik v3 removes the Consul provider `tls.caOptional` static configuration option (YAML `providers.consul.tls.caOptional`, TOML `[providers.consul.tls] caOptional`, CLI `--providers.consul.tls.caOptional=true`), because TLS client authentication is a server-side option, and the migration guide instructs operators to remove `tls.caOptional` from the Consul provider static configuration."
    },
    "corrected": {
      "applicability": {
        "exposure": {
          "op": "any",
          "of": [
            {
              "op": "cli-flag",
              "name": "--providers.consul.tls.caOptional",
              "state": "set"
            },
            {
              "op": "env-var",
              "name": "TRAEFIK_PROVIDERS_CONSUL_TLS_CAOPTIONAL",
              "state": "set"
            },
            {
              "op": "resource",
              "of": [
                {
                  "op": "text-line",
                  "path": "data[\"traefik.yml\"]",
                  "state": "exists",
                  "pattern": "^\\s*consul\\s*:"
                },
                {
                  "op": "text-line",
                  "path": "data[\"traefik.yml\"]",
                  "state": "exists",
                  "pattern": "^\\s*caOptional\\s*:"
                }
              ],
              "kind": "ConfigMap"
            },
            {
              "op": "resource",
              "of": [
                {
                  "op": "text-line",
                  "path": "data[\"traefik.yaml\"]",
                  "state": "exists",
                  "pattern": "^\\s*consul\\s*:"
                },
                {
                  "op": "text-line",
                  "path": "data[\"traefik.yaml\"]",
                  "state": "exists",
                  "pattern": "^\\s*caOptional\\s*:"
                }
              ],
              "kind": "ConfigMap"
            },
            {
              "op": "resource",
              "of": [
                {
                  "op": "text-line",
                  "path": "data[\"traefik.toml\"]",
                  "state": "exists",
                  "pattern": "^\\s*\\[providers\\.consul(\\.tls)?\\]"
                },
                {
                  "op": "text-line",
                  "path": "data[\"traefik.toml\"]",
                  "state": "exists",
                  "pattern": "caOptional\\s*="
                }
              ],
              "kind": "ConfigMap"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "statement": "Exposed: environments that set the Consul provider tls.caOptional option, via the --providers.consul.tls.caOptional CLI flag, the TRAEFIK_PROVIDERS_CONSUL_TLS_CAOPTIONAL env var, or a static config file in a ConfigMap (traefik.yml/.yaml/.toml) with a caOptional line and a Consul provider section in the same file."
    },
